  "title": "Auditory naming",
  "description": "This dataset comprises intracranial EEG recordings from 106 individuals performing an auditory-naming task, with electrode coordinates provided in MNI-305 space. It supports investigation of the dynamic causal network underlying auditory descriptive naming, as reported by Kanno et al. (2025). The dataset accompanies analysis code for tractography-based network analysis.",
  "methods_description": "Intracranial EEG data were recorded during an auditory-naming task, with EDF files annotated using event codes for stimulus onset (401), stimulus offset (402), and response onset (501). Electrode coordinates were localized in MNI-305 space.",
